      "en": "After the death of Saul, when David had returned from the slaughter of the Amalekites, and David had stayed two days in Ziklag,",
      "ko": "사울의 죽은 후라 다윗이 아말렉 사람을 도륙하고 돌아와서 시글락에서 이틀을 유하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "9409213dee1eb746505b281b24c69b9f60dceded1c945f609dfa05515929deb9",
      "translation_text_hash": "0c590b752af75521c3920c615673c72fd2cfcac72a7255e69ff28343793c2f07",
