      "en": "So I stood beside him and killed him, because I was sure that he could not live after he had fallen. I took the crown that was on his head and the bracelet that was on his arm, and have brought them here to my lord.”",
      "ko": "저가 엎드러진 후에는 살 수 없는 줄을 내가 알고 그 곁에 서서 죽이고 그 머리에 있는 면류관과 팔에 있는 고리를 벗겨서 내 주께로 가져왔나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "b194a5aec52f933ba90fb33ce5500654131ffa474cd772443019facd814b3abf",
      "translation_text_hash": "4cdeee63ce69a9c3bbd0ffa6d4dab8f4c3785b4a0e4d2fa54ef575cc1eae06d8",
